                                "sense_id": "f3711624-1e66-38cb-b09a-601030ceaad1",
                                "text": "They went downstairs in their gay cotton house-coats and found Mrs Dibble in the kitchen, doddering over a lunch that required no preparation, being merely a section of ham sausage and a few pickled onions."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "606860f4-8d85-4991-9c84-84d53c991e7a",
                                "sense_id": "f3711624-1e66-38cb-b09a-601030ceaad1",
                                "text": "Her housecoat had fallen open. She was wearing only panties and bra, which did nothing to make her scrawny, wrinkled body appealing."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
